{"ID":"20240523081636-clyh4ng","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","icon":"1f3b8","id":"20240523081636-clyh4ng","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240523081636-clyh4ng\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240523081658-bdqiy5n\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240523081804-53hgpno\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:23,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240523081804-53hgpno\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"35.天紀與人紀的著作權聲明","type":"doc","updated":"20240523094545"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240523081658-bdqiy5n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240523081658-bdqiy5n","updated":"20240523081658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"本人之網站設立於美國，受到美國聯邦智慧財產權法的保護，請尊重智慧財產權，本網頁中有應用到的新聞報導部分，其所有著作權均屬於原媒體單位的，本人是引用它來做為評論之依據，所有評論部分是屬於本人之智慧財產權。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"任何人如果使用本人網站中的文章與知識**** "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":","},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"但是必須註明出處"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":","},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"竊取本人之專業知識據為己有"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":","},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"為違反智慧財產權法"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":","},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"本人將追究其刑事責任"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":","},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"絕不姑息養奸"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":","},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"請勿以身試法"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":","},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"如果你想引用本網站之文章，著作權皆屬本人所有，任何人作文字轉載或網站轉貼，均須經本人同意」"}]},{"ID":"20240523081658-sz1n6o4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240523081658-sz1n6o4","updated":"20240523081658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"天紀是一部講解易經與紫微斗數的命理哲學，同時配合易經地理學來做加減，這部天紀是本人於1994年所創作，一共有24片DVD及附加一片算命程式，還有書籍二本，書名一本是人間道，一本是天機道與地脈道，人間道是直接附在DVD中，贈與購買者，天機道與地脈道是不在贈品之列，按照智慧財產權創作保護法的規定，本人享有著作權之保護，任何人未經本人同意而複製、販賣、或公開於公共場合播放給不特定人士觀看等行為，皆屬侵犯智慧財產權之違法行為，一但出現這種侵權行為，本人將追究其應負之法律責任。"}]},{"ID":"20240523081702-9sm6ut8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240523081702-9sm6ut8"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"人紀系列是我完成於2007年07月30日，這部人紀共分五大經典著作，針灸學，黃帝內經，神農本草經，傷寒論，金匱等，這部人紀受到智慧財產權之創作保護，本人擁有一切的權利，任何人未經本人授權而擅自複製、販賣、或公開於公共場合播放給不特定人士觀看等行為，皆屬侵犯智慧財產權之違法行為，一但出現這種侵權行為，本人將追究其應負之法律責任。"}]},{"ID":"20240523081658-wa9foq2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240523081658-wa9foq2","updated":"20240523081704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"人紀系列計有 :針灸DVD10片，針灸書籍一本;黃帝內經DVD10片，書二本;神農本草經DVD9片，書一本; 傷寒論DVD八片，書一本;金匱DVD10片，書一本。"}]},{"ID":"20240523081705-1red06o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240523081705-1red06o","updated":"20240523081717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"購買者請傳真到台灣台北訂購傳真號碼:02-8786-2078。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"如有任何疑問時，請跟苗小姐連絡。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240523081717-xpoeoig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240523081717-xpoeoig","updated":"20240523081730"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"北京市德恒（深圳）律師事務所 合夥人凃江麗律師及其團隊係受本人委託保護本人在大陸地區之著作權律師團隊, 凡是在大陸地區出現違反著作權法之事由，將由我的委任律師出面，追究此等之違法行為，請勿觸法，請自重。"}]},{"ID":"20240523081728-jnx9rn7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240523081728-jnx9rn7","updated":"20240523081734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"請發現盜版的同學、中醫愛好者及時向律師舉報."}]},{"ID":"20240523081741-vxp020u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240523081741-vxp020u","updated":"20240523081741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"北京市德恒（深圳）律師事務所  凃江麗律師"}]},{"ID":"20240523081741-ivwlh2y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240523081741-ivwlh2y","updated":"20240523081747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"地址：深圳市福田區金田路安聯大廈B座11樓"}]},{"ID":"20240523081747-j0mua74","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240523081747-j0mua74","updated":"20240523081752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"郵箱：tujl@dhlsz.com"}]},{"ID":"20240523081753-9rwsrcr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240523081753-9rwsrcr"}},{"ID":"20240523081753-kb9c4j0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240523081753-kb9c4j0","updated":"20240523081759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於2011年03月22日"}]},{"ID":"20240523081800-gljwvme","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240523081800-gljwvme","updated":"20240523081803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"笑話一則 :"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 有學生居然很天真的以為如果要發揚傳統中醫文化，最好的方法就是將老師的天紀、人紀上傳到網路上，公開給不特定人士觀看，殊不知這種作法已經觸法，不但讓老師生氣，更是很明顯的違反著作權法，老師不會因為是我的學生而不去計較，請同學們不要再犯了。"}]},{"ID":"20240523081804-53hgpno","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240523081804-53hgpno"}}]}